 : `Annual entitlement: Vacation ${ANNUAL_ENTITLEMENTS.vacation?.days}d • Sick ${ANNUAL_ENTITLEMENTS.sick?.days}d • WFH ${ANNUAL_ENTITLEMENTS.wfh?.days}d`}
